                          WEBGENIX — IMPROVEMENT ROADMAP
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

A. TESTING & QUALITY
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
A1. [HIGH] NO TESTING FRAMEWORK
     package.json test script: "echo \"Error: no test specified\" && exit 1"
     → Add Vitest (frontend) + Jest/Mocha (backend), write unit/integration tests
     → Target: API endpoint tests, auth flow tests, billing lifecycle tests

A2. [MEDIUM] NO FRONTEND TESTING
     Zero component tests, no React Testing Library setup
     → Add Vitest + @testing-library/react for component-level tests

A3. [MEDIUM] NO E2E TESTS
     No Playwright or Cypress for full user-journey testing
     → Add Playwright: test registration → purchase → ticket creation flow

A4. [MEDIUM] NO TYPE CHECKING
     Backend uses plain JS, frontend uses plain JSX (no TypeScript)
     → Migrate to TypeScript for type safety (gradual adoption via JSDoc first)

A5. [HIGH] LINTING INCOMPLETE
     Frontend has ESLint config but no lint script for backend
     → Add ESLint + Prettier to backend, enforce consistent code style

B. MONITORING & OBSERVABILITY
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
B1. [HIGH] NO CENTRALIZED LOGGING
     Console-based logger (simple timestamps), no log levels or transports
     → Replace with Winston/Pino: file rotation, log levels, JSON output

B2. [MEDIUM] NO APM / PERFORMANCE MONITORING
     No Sentry, Datadog, New Relic, or OpenTelemetry instrumentation
     → Add Sentry for error tracking + performance traces

B3. [LOW] NO HEALTH CHECK ENDPOINTS FOR DEPENDENCIES
     Single /api/health returns "OK" — no MongoDB check
     → Add MongoDB ping check, response time, memory usage to health endpoint

C. DATABASE & DATA INTEGRITY
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
C1. [HIGH] NO DATABASE TRANSACTIONS
     Code explicitly notes "local MongoDB standalone does not support transactions"
     → Upgrade to MongoDB replica set for transaction support
     → Use transactions for critical paths: order creation, payment capture

C2. [MEDIUM] NO INDEXING AUDIT
     Schemas have some indexes but no comprehensive audit of query patterns
     → Analyze slow queries, add compound indexes for common filters (status+userId, etc.)

C3. [MEDIUM] NO DATA MIGRATION SYSTEM
     Schema changes applied manually — no migration framework
     → Add migrate-mongo or custom migration runner for versioned schema changes

C4. [LOW] NO SOFT DELETE PATTERN
     Many models support hard deletion — no archived/trashed state
     → Add isDeleted/deletedAt fields to User, Product, Ticket for safe recovery

C5. [MEDIUM] NO BACKUP VERIFICATION
     Backup script exists but no automated restore test or verification
     → Add backup integrity check, automated restore test in CI

D. SECURITY
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
D1. [HIGH] NO RATE LIMITING ON LOGIN
     Auth module has rate limiting but no account lockout after N failed attempts
     → Track failed login attempts per email, temporary lockout (e.g., 15min after 5 fails)

D2. [MEDIUM] PASSWORD POLICY TOO BASIC
     Zod validation: min 8 chars, 1 uppercase, 1 lowercase, 1 digit, 1 special
     → Add common-password check (rockyou.txt top 10k), max age enforcement

D3. [MEDIUM] NO CSRF PROTECTION
     JWT in localStorage is vulnerable to XSS-driven token theft
     → Move access token to httpOnly cookie on auth domain, implement CSRF token

D4. [MEDIUM] NO API KEY SYSTEM
     No way for external services to call APIs programmatically
     → Add API key generation with scoped permissions for integrations

D5. [LOW] NO IP WHITELISTING
     Admin routes not restricted by IP
     → Add optional IP whitelist middleware for admin/billing routes

D6. [HIGH] ENV FILE COMMITTED?
     .env files present in repo — may contain secrets
     → Ensure .env is in .gitignore, use .env.example only

E. PAYMENTS & BILLING
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
E1. [HIGH] NO PAYMENT RETRY LOGIC
     Failed payments not retried automatically
     → Add smart dunning: retry at day 3, 7, 14 with decreasing amounts or partial

E2. [MEDIUM] STRIPE INTEGRATION PARTIAL
     Stripe service exists but unused in payment flow
     → Complete Stripe integration as a payment option alongside Razorpay

E3. [HIGH] NO REFUND WORKFLOW
     Refund function exists in service but no UI or admin workflow
     → Build refund UI in admin panel, handle partial/full refund with reversal

E4. [MEDIUM] NO SUBSCRIPTION MANAGEMENT
     Services are auto-renewed via cron but no native subscription model
     → Add Stripe/Razorpay subscription sync, cancellation at gateway level

E5. [MEDIUM] NO TAX CALCULATION AT CHECKOUT
     Tax rules defined but not applied during order creation
     → Integrate tax engine into invoice calculation

E6. [LOW] NO MULTI-CURRENCY SUPPORT
     All pricing in USD — no currency conversion
     → Add currency model, exchange rate provider, per-currency pricing

E7. [MEDIUM] NO INVOICE EMAILING
     PDF generation works but invoices not sent via email
     → Auto-email invoices on creation and overdue reminders

F. USER EXPERIENCE & FRONTEND
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
F1. [HIGH] NO LOADING/SKELETON STATES
     Many pages show raw loading indicators, no skeleton screens
     → Add skeleton components for dashboard, ticket list, service pages

F2. [MEDIUM] NO OPTIMISTIC UPDATES
     UI waits for server response before updating state
     → Use React Query optimistic updates for mutations (ticket reply, status change)

F3. [LOW] NO PAGINATION ON ADMIN TABLES
     DataTable component exists but infinite scroll may not handle millions of rows
     → Add server-side pagination, sort, filter for admin list pages

F4. [MEDIUM] NO NOTIFICATION SYSTEM (FRONTEND)
     Backend has Notification model but no frontend display
     → Build notification bell dropdown with real-time updates

F5. [HIGH] NO REAL-TIME UPDATES
     No WebSocket/Socket.IO — users must refresh to see ticket replies or status changes
     → Add Socket.IO for real-time: ticket messages, notification badges, order status

F6. [MEDIUM] NO MOBILE RESPONSIVENESS AUDIT
     Dashboard layout may not be fully responsive
     → Audit all pages at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px breakpoints

F7. [MEDIUM] NO OFFLINE STATE HANDLING
     Network errors show generic toast — no offline indicator
     → Add navigator.onLine detection, queue failed mutations for retry

F8. [LOW] NO KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
     Support agents could benefit from keyboard navigation (Ctrl+Enter to reply, etc.)
     → Add hotkey system for power users

F9. [LOW] NO THEME PERSISTENCE
     Dark theme only — no light mode toggle
     → Add theme switcher with localStorage persistence

G. PERFORMANCE
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
G1. [MEDIUM] NO DATABASE QUERY OPTIMIZATION
     No .select() or .lean() usage in most queries — returns full Mongoose docs
     → Add .lean() for read-only queries, .select() for field restriction

G2. [MEDIUM] NO RESPONSE COMPRESSION
     Large invoice PDFs and API responses not compressed
     → Add compression middleware (express.js built-in or shrink-ray)

G3. [LOW] NO CDN FOR STATIC ASSETS
     Frontend served through Nginx — no CDN
     → Add CloudFront/CDN for dist/ assets, cache headers

G4. [LOW] NO LAZY LOADING FOR ROUTES
     All components eagerly imported in App.jsx
     → Use React.lazy + Suspense for route-level code splitting

G5. [MEDIUM] NO SERVER-SIDE CACHING
     Frequent queries (product list, settings) not cached
     → Add in-memory cache (node-cache) with TTL for slow-moving data

G6. [MEDIUM] NO IMAGE OPTIMIZATION
     Uploaded images served as-is — no resizing or format conversion
     → Add Sharp middleware for automatic image optimization on upload

